      "writtenOn": "2022-10-26T02:48:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oops. Regarding NPCX9M8S, I suggest using the spec. listed in our datasheet since partial data ram is reserved for specific features.\n\n```\n#define NPCX9M8S_RAM_ADDR 0x10058000\n#define NPCX9M8S_RAM_SIZE 0x80000\n```\n\nIn chip/npcx/config_chip-npcx9.h.\n```\n/*\n * 416KBprogram RAM, 1MB of Flash.\n */\n#define NPCX_PROGRAM_MEMORY_SIZE (416* 1024 - 0x1000)\n/* program memory base address for Code RAM (0x100C0000 - 416KB) */\n#define CONFIG_PROGRAM_MEMORY_BASE 0x10058000\n#define CONFIG_RAM_BASE 0x200C0000 /* memory address of data ram */\n/* Three blocks of data RAM - reserve 4KB for ROM utilities and data ram size is 92KB */\n#define CONFIG_DATA_RAM_SIZE (96* 1024 - 0x1000)\n#define CONFIG_RAM_SIZE CONFIG_DATA_RAM_SIZE\n\n/* Override default NPCX_RAM_SIZE because we\u0027re excluding a block. */\n#undef NPCX_RAM_SIZE\n#define NPCX_RAM_SIZE (CONFIG_DATA_RAM_SIZE + NPCX_PROGRAM_MEMORY_SIZE + 0x2000)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "277b5097_655e0816",
      "revId": "74dce181fd3d1f85a932116049135563ff1e9a06",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    }
